        # v2.1.1 [aiagent-spark-free-api-client-do FIRED v2.1.1] alias=aiagent-spark-free-api-client-do
        # ROOT-CAUSE FIX (from live v210 NCDOT run 318828929774768 2026-05-27 04:54:48):
